+## Feedback still fires HERE, on the input event — that is the 30 ms budget, and
+## deferring it to the tick would add up to 8 ms of latency for nothing. Only the
+## physics waits for the tick.
+func _queue_flap() -> void:
+	_flap_queued = true
+	Sfx.play("flap")
+	Sfx.buzz(12)
+
